      "text": "Fighter Wings and soldiers from the 35th ADA."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.28,
      "e": 38.54,
      "text": "(crowd yelling and crying)"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.54,
      "e": 40.01,
      "text": "- I just kinda stopped because we saw"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.01,
      "e": 41.76,
      "text": "smoke coming out of the building."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.76,
      "e": 43.8,
      "text": "- All of a sudden, I see the lady with the kids,"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.8,
      "e": 46.77,
      "text": "trying to get her out and I was like, \"No! No! No! No!\""
    },
    {
      "s": 46.77,
      "e": 49.16,
      "text": "- I ran in and grabbed the blanket because"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.16,
      "e": 52.07,
      "text": "my mind set was double up the blanket."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.07,
      "e": 53.43,
