    },
    {
      "s": 53.43,
      "e": 54.84,
      "text": "- We had all come around here."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.84,
      "e": 57.9,
      "text": "I just remember the smoke, the black smoke,"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.9,
